// A tile that shows one side at a time.

a "flip tile" is a view where:
	- its "side" is one of up, down
		- it "is showing (side)"
	// Sent each time it turns over
	- it sends "flipped" with count as a number
	// Turns it over.
	- to flip it:
		- shortcut meta+F
		- enabled when it is showing up
		- undone as "Flip Tile"
		if it is showing up
			set its side to down
		otherwise
			set its side to up
	- to draw its face:
		<ui-text>face</ui-text>
	- to draw its back:
		<ui-text>back</ui-text>
	- to draw it:
		if it is showing up
			draw its face
		otherwise
			draw its back
	- on mouse down: flip it
